										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><a href="https://www.mysaline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/SCF-2026-winners-announcement.png"><img decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-121338" src="https://www.mysaline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/SCF-2026-winners-announcement.png" alt="" width="400" srcset="https://www.mysaline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/SCF-2026-winners-announcement.png 1000w, https://www.mysaline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/SCF-2026-winners-announcement-300x240.png 300w, https://www.mysaline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/SCF-2026-winners-announcement-600x480.png 600w, https://www.mysaline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/SCF-2026-winners-announcement-150x120.png 150w" sizes="(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px" /></a></p>
<hr />
<p>MySaline held nominations in June, voting in July, and now it&#8217;s August, so it&#8217;s time to announce the WINNERS for the 2026 <a href="https://www.facebook.com/search/posts?q=salinecountyfavorites&amp;%3D" target="_blank" rel="noopener">#SalineCountyFavorites</a>!</p>
<p>We will also announce the prize winner for $100 cash SOON. You were qualified for the prize drawing if&#8230; you voted in at least 20 categories, and at least one time in each of the 4 sections of the survey (Food, Businesses, People, Places&amp;Things.</p>
<p><strong>Important stuff!! If you won one or more categories:</strong></p>
