<li>and <span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong><a style="text-decoration: underline;" href="https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/12FoKgjQSoqDV5cW0rupo8HEF6RgKkDby?usp=sharing">look here</a></strong></span> to find your personalized winner image to use on social media!</li>
</ul>
<h3><strong>🏆</strong>And now&#8230; the winners are&#8230;.</h3>
